{
  "dom_id": "step-t8687",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Suppose we want to find all of the values of $x$ that satisfy *both* $3x+9 \\geq 0$ *and* $2x \\leq -2$ simultaneously. \n\nTo do this, we solve each inequality individually and then compute the intersection of the two solutions.\n\n- We start by solving $3x + 9 \\geq 0\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+9 & \\ge 0 \\\\ 3x+9-9 & \\ge 0-9 \\\\ 3x & \\ge -9 \\\\ \\frac{3x}{3} & \\ge \\frac{-9}{3} \\\\ x & \\ge -3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this inequality is shown on the number line below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194110/assets/5127629c09f32bb8ed7872b476322d6973e44e82be7977492c8dd0967d3cb0ec.png)\n\n- Then, we solve $2x \\leq -2\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & \\le -2 \\\\ \\frac{2x}{2} & \\le \\frac{-2}{2} \\\\ x & \\le -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this inequality is shown on the number line below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194110/assets/35e30bc9c45b08793d847c8750698f7d9dab781438405239ed4483ce82f2dcfb.png)\n\nTo find the values of $x$ that satisfy both inequalities, we find where the two solutions overlap:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194110/assets/fe4c223767cb06d9d620d32f5e668c7305688b3870bf0317304c56b11053e19f.png)\n\nThus, the final solution is $\\color{blue}-3 \\leq x \\leq -1.$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t8687\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t8687\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n      