" width=\"1193\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"346\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"860\" y=\"-2366\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(1422,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(0,2265)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2264\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"2112\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-79)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2264\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1334,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1399\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"778\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"449\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-2366)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2264\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"2112\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nThe solution to this inequality is shown on the number line below.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-cbd11e3c7e4794d3e255b7956ac308f7\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/cbd11e3c7e4794d3e255b7956ac308f7\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p>To find the values of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.33ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 572.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">x</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> that satisfy both inequalities, we find where the two solutions overlap:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-52f64062ce2e596fecab5cf9954b9b59\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/52f64062ce2e596fecab5cf9954b9b59\"></div>\n\n\n<p>Thus, the final solution is <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"14.115ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 6077.1 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\\color{blue}-3 \\leq x \\leq -1.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T1